07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E31JCrSDuKwQ7kNvwG-Ta7A&_nc_oc=AdrQ2XWDMSPOQyBJcMoo0ZAbG_JNx0Ci7JGK7BOoWESnAJzI4XGN_MAwz2g7aQh7AiQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEPgPMSumdt3NMkKcdzO77wVeiSslFDMt1MNO0jLBLktQ&oe=6A8469C2"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YJjDlz7ib8UQ7kNvwFxo1-_&_nc_oc=AdojnJNFtMWgfwj08pcRCyWwQVlj7hFE1JCTOrRoRgmssIW1Nq0_ba82RgEZw_LgpXQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGEpdyPfhQaiAGdfpjhM8Cxy9PLkRNTaOgi0QcT3LtOwQ&oe=6A845F3F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X93wQIq8tvIQ7kNvwGH-lLt&_nc_oc=Adrm86mMGkqmziZhQm0O5sKDCcLVnkirVrIs7HyeDUubLO0cUOSGbvtzdXZ5XwjGMFU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHtEQVTynMcRiy1ZQ0lIsK8GYMdfiHmnuEx-FBZ4RDQtQ&oe=6A8435F0"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic